	(text "All 4 outbound channels (PD1_COMP, PD2_COMP, ACC_TRIG, RHS_STIM_OUT) now have"
		(at 179.07 290.83 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "56504abb-1d16-4dc4-8b92-380026a42491")
	)
	(text "a real driver elsewhere in this project (Task 10d's LM339 for the first three,"
		(at 179.07 295.91 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "5b14c551-66b1-4d27-b2eb-1fdedd4db1c6")
	)
	(text "Task 11's ACSL-6420 for RHS_STIM_OUT) -- no PWR_FLAGs remain on this sheet for"
		(at 179.07 300.99 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "5700767d-e165-4701-a892-29462dea573c")
	)
	(text "any of them. See _place_outbound()'s own docstring ('TASK 11 UPDATE') for the"
		(at 179.07 306.07 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "4064e7fb-e83f-47fa-9a57-bdc8b1b65559")
	)
	(text "deletion history."
		(at 179.07 311.15 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "1400c9c0-9c06-468c-baa4-e6a9649005be")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 179.07 316.23 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f889f52d-53ad-4167-a93e-4ef38fd8c038")
	)
	(text "CHANNELS 4/5 (PD1_COMP_BUF, PD2_COMP_BUF) ARE NOT OUTBOUND -- they do not reach"
		(at 179.07 321.31 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "715d3fee-3c9b-4bf0-8ce8-8847118e3279")
	)
	(text "Connector 1 at all. They exist so opto-ni's own U61 LEDs are driven from a"
		(at 179.07 326.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a5ecd4f6-7e40-4f0b-b11b-5aa103bac71b")
	)
	(text "buffered leg instead of hanging directly on PD1_COMP/PD2_COMP, which wire"
		(at 179.07 331.47 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f49cdbbb-b2bd-4ef8-95c3-a8f111133cab")
	)
	(text "STRAIGHT into the sync module's GPIO20/GPIO21 (3.3V, not 5V tolerant). An LED"
		(at 179.07 336.55 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "cefe56aa-b8a1-4e5d-a0ff-271af3efa09a")
	)
	(text "there means +5V through 430R and the LED reaches that pin: idling ~3.6-3.8V"
		(at 179.07 341.63 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8968d0bb-76b5-4ff8-a211-7e82e2beb610")
	)
	(text "with the LED off (above the 3.3V rail, held only by the module's ESD clamp),"
		(at 179.07 346.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "70a0ad8f-e74c-4127-89e0-51e74ed9b58e")
	)
	(text "and injecting ~7mA into an unpowered pad whenever this board is on and the sync"
		(at 179.07 351.79 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "936bc371-3ad7-419f-96b2-cd946cf965ef")
	)
	(text "box is not. These were the only 2 of 24 NI optocoupler LEDs not driven from a"
